                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game has the classic \"adventure game\" problem in which you have no idea what you are supposed to do to progress or even what the puzzles are. There is no dialogue, no hint system, and the surreal world means that you generaly wouldn't be able to guess what the next thing you need to do is.\n\nAdditionally, I have been unable to find a complete walkthrough anywhere on the internet. I only reccomend this to hardcore adventure gamers.",
